 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A 3D volume $V_i$ (downsampled to a fixed resolution, typically $128^3$), image resolution, camera pose $\eta$, and transfer function parameters $\kappa$.
-*   **Output:** Predicted rendering time $t_{pred}$.
