+1.  **VolumeNet (Autoencoder):** Encoder consists of 5 convolutional layers followed by a fully connected layer; decoder uses transposed convolutional layers [S1, unofficial]. Outputs a feature vector $X_i$ of dimension $F$ [S1, unofficial].
+2.  **PredNet (Prediction Network):** Consists exclusively of fully connected layers with SELU activation [S1, unofficial]. Input is the concatenation of $X_i$, $\eta$, $\kappa$, and image resolution [S1, unofficial].
 
